---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CV">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-2">Matthew Salem</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-400">IT Professional specializing in low-voltage systems and network design</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Professional Summary -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-4 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">Professional Summary</h2>
            <div class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>
                    IT, Low-Voltage, and Wiring/Cabling Professional with diverse technical expertise across networking, system design, surveillance, and building automation. Experienced in bridging analog and digital systems during the industry's pivotal transition.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Currently working as an electrical technician while architecting AI-powered solutions that leverage modern infrastructure and agentic workflows.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Work Experience -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">Work Experience</h2>

            <div class="space-y-8">
                <!-- Electrical Technician -->
                <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500/30 pl-6">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200">Electrical Technician</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-400">Mixed Residential & Light Commercial</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">2024 - 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-400 space-y-2 text-sm mt-3">
                        <li>• Residential and light commercial electrical installations</li>
                        <li>• Power distribution and service installations</li>
                        <li>• Low-voltage integration with building systems</li>
                        <li>• Maintaining hands-on connection to physical infrastructure</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Independent Consultant -->
                <div class="border-l-2 border-blue-500/30 pl-6">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200">Independent Consultant</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-400">Cullen Technologies — Flushing, MI</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">2014 - 2023</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-400 space-y-2 text-sm mt-3">
                        <li>• Provided comprehensive desktop support, resolving software and hardware issues efficiently</li>
                        <li>• Implemented remote PC support solutions, enabling seamless troubleshooting and assistance</li>
                        <li>• Managed networks by configuring routers, switches, and firewalls</li>
                        <li>• Optimized network performance and security</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- SalemNet IT Solutions -->
                <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500/30 pl-6">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200">Owner Operator / Independent Contractor</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-400">SalemNet IT Solutions LLC — Flint, MI</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">2012 - 2020</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-3">
                        Operated as a "jack-of-all-trades," subcontracting for companies specializing in VOIP, managed services, automation, surveillance, and access control systems while also managing my own client projects.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Detroit Work Highlight -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/20 to-blue-900/20 border border-emerald-700/30 rounded-lg p-4 mb-3">
                        <p class="text-emerald-400 font-medium text-sm mb-2">Detroit Metro Work</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                            Proud to have worked with <strong class="text-gray-300">Intellitech</strong> and <strong class="text-gray-300">Simply Tech</strong> on enterprise-scale installations in the Detroit area. These projects ranged from high-end residential to large-scale commercial deployments, teaching me how to design reliable systems that organizations depend on.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="text-gray-400 space-y-2 text-sm mt-3">
                        <li>• High-end residential to large-scale commercial deployments</li>
                        <li>• VOIP phone systems and unified communications</li>
                        <li>• Surveillance, access control, and security systems</li>
                        <li>• Distributed audio and home automation (URC-certified)</li>
                        <li>• Structured cabling and network infrastructure</li>
                        <li>• Commercial AV installations for bars, restaurants, and venues</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Technical Expertise -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">Technical Expertise</h2>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-3">Networking & IT</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">TCP/IP</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Network Design</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Microsoft & Linux</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Wireless Systems</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">VoIP Systems</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-3">Low-Voltage & Automation</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Structured Cabling</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Surveillance Systems</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Access Control</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">URC-Certified</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Commercial AV</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-3">Emerging Technologies</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">IoT (LoRaWAN, Zigbee, Z-Wave)</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">MQTT Protocol</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Smart Building Systems</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-3">AI & Modern Infrastructure</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Docker</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Ollama</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Qdrant</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Claude</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Cursor</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded text-sm text-gray-400">Agentic Workflows</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Additional Background -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">Additional Background</h2>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-400">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-2">Electrical Experience</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Trained as an electrical apprentice with hands-on experience in residential wiring and light commercial service installations. Gained invaluable experience working alongside analog-era electricians during the industry's transition to digital systems, becoming the bridge between traditional electrical work and modern network-integrated building systems.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-200 mb-2">Restaurant & Property Management</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Deep background in restaurant operations and property management, providing unique insight into designing IT and low-voltage solutions that align with business goals. This experience informs practical system design that meets real operational needs.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Education & Certifications -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">Education & Certifications</h2>

            <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-400">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300">Networking & IT Education</p>
                        <p class="text-sm">Microsoft and Linux networking • A+ coursework completed in high school</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300">URC Certified</p>
                        <p class="text-sm">Universal Remote Control home automation certification</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300">Electrical Apprenticeship</p>
                        <p class="text-sm">Hands-on training in residential and commercial electrical work</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>
